        "content": "<div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333;\"><h2 style=\"color: #0284c7;\">🦷 New Practice Quote Request</h2><table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 15px;\"><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;\"><strong>Practice Name:</strong></td><td style=\"padding: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;\">{{1.practiceName}}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;\"><strong>Doctor / Contact:</strong></td><td style=\"padding: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;\">{{1.contactName}}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;\"><strong>Location:</strong></td><td style=\"padding: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;\">{{1.city}}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;\"><strong>High-Ticket Goal:</strong></td><td style=\"padding: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;\">{{1.procedureGoal}}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;\"><strong>Stated Budget:</strong></td><td style=\"padding: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;\">{{1.monthlyBudget}}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;\"><strong>Direct Phone:</strong></td><td style=\"padding: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;\"><a href=\"tel:{{1.phone}}\">{{1.phone}}</a></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;\"><strong>Email Address:</strong></td><td style=\"padding: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;\"><a href=\"mailto:{{1.email}}\">{{1.email}}</a></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;\"><strong>Lead ID:</strong></td><td style=\"padding: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;\">{{1.leadId}}</td></tr></table><div style=\"margin-top: 25px; padding: 15px; background-color: #f0f9ff; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #bae6fd;\"><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 14px;\"><strong>Monetization Value:</strong> This qualified inquiry has an unlock fee of <strong>{{1.unlockPrice}}</strong> for agency distribution.</p></div></div>"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "designer": {
          "x": 300,
          "y": 0,
          "name": "Send Instant Alert"
